  "job_B9.5.5_20251003_115024": {
    "chunk_text": "him: geseoh, \u00fe\u00e6t ic \u00fee sylle \u00feysne man to gehwearfe for Gedo me \u00fe\u00e6t an to are, agif me minne agene sunu. & \u00fea \u00fea he geseah \u00feone biscop f\u00e6gerne on ansyne, \u00fea acsode man hine, hwylcne cr\u00e6ft he cu\u00f0e. Him \u00fea se drihtnes wer Paulinus andswarode & cw\u00e6\u00f0: ne can ic n\u00e6nigne o\u00feerne cr\u00e6ft buton \u00de\u00e6t \u00fea se h\u00e6\u00feena wer swi\u00fee lustlice onfeng, \u00fea \u00fea he gehyrde, \u00fe\u00e6t he gel\u00e6red w\u00e6s wyrta to & \u00fea \u00fea se ylca cyningces a\u00f0um gelomlice eode in \u00feone wyrtgeard & sumra wyrta acsode \u00feone & \u00fea ongan he his freond & his geferan bebugan & gelomlice sprecan wi\u00fe \u00feone his wyrtweard & \u00deam gewunode Paulinus d\u00e6ghwamlice bringan to beode grene wyrta wel stincende & onfangenum & \u00fea \u00fea he \u00feis wel lange gedyde, \u00fea sume d\u00e6ge he spr\u00e6c to his hlaforde & \u00feus cw\u00e6\u00f0 on \u00dea he \u00feis gehyrde, he hit \u00feam cyningce ne forh\u00e6l, for\u00feon \u00fee he synderlice w\u00e6s gelufod fram him, \u00dea \u00fea se cyning \u00feis gehyrde, he sona cw\u00e6\u00f0: ic wolde geseon \u00feisne man, \u00fee \u00feu me big s\u00e6gst. Him \u00fea his a\u00f0um & Paulinus hwilena hlaford andswarode & cw\u00e6\u00f0: grene wyrta he is gewunod \u00dea w\u00e6s geworden, \u00fe\u00e6t se cyning s\u00e6t \u00e6t his mete. \u00deyder com Paulinus & brohte of his weorce gehwylce grene & wel stincende wyrta",
